WEBVTT

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:20.790
Its body is armored in iron and concrete.

00:00:21.430 --> 00:00:25.450
Its mind is wrapped in computers and high technology.

00:00:25.450 --> 00:00:28.740
This is the city and the time we are living in.

00:00:29.510 --> 00:00:32.470
But most people are ignoring the unexplainable or mysterious.

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:37.150
Those things that we can't figure out through ordinary logic.

00:00:37.150 --> 00:00:39.610
Around these ordinary people, following common rules...

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.530
all the while seeking out strong desires and pleasures...

00:00:45.530 --> 00:00:48.750
and hanging on to a little happiness...

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:59.430
there exists a vast and fearful world of darkness beyond our time and space.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:04.900
I'm afraid I know about that.

00:01:22.780 --> 00:01:24.270
Taki, here you go.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:27.970
I lost the bet, so I have to pay.

00:01:27.970 --> 00:01:29.920
You just guessed wrong.

00:01:29.920 --> 00:01:33.820
Yeah, but I've been a bartender for a long time.

00:01:33.820 --> 00:01:38.140
I've never seen a girl who's kept her guard up as much as Kanako.

00:01:38.140 --> 00:01:40.940
How could I have imagined that she'd accept your offer?

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:43.180
Tough luck! I'll keep this.

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:47.290
Well, she's sure taking her time.

00:02:08.650 --> 00:02:10.440
Thanks for waiting.

00:02:10.840 --> 00:02:13.440
Here she comes. 10,000 yen.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.940
10,000 yen? What do you mean?

00:02:16.730 --> 00:02:19.920
Well, it's none of your business. Is it Taki?

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:20.450
Yes.

00:02:21.020 --> 00:02:22.980
Oh, don't be so secretive.

00:02:22.980 --> 00:02:25.620
Alright, I'll find out tomorrow!

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:26.450
Let's go!

00:02:27.530 --> 00:02:29.950
So long Ken. Get back to work!

00:02:29.950 --> 00:02:31.460
Got it. See you.

00:02:32.340 --> 00:02:35.580
Hey Taki. Why don't we bet on the Giants and Tigers game, next?

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.510
A re-match?

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:39.470
I accept!

00:02:40.890 --> 00:02:43.790
That night, I was happy. Like I fell into rapture.

00:02:44.860 --> 00:02:48.300
She was the girl that I liked, from the bar I'd been frequenting for three months.

00:02:48.300 --> 00:02:51.420
Finally, she asked me over to her place.

00:02:53.570 --> 00:02:55.270
This was a surprise.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:57.240
What made you change your mind?

00:03:08.280 --> 00:03:09.640
Wow...

00:03:09.640 --> 00:03:11.750
You live in this luxurious place?

00:03:44.940 --> 00:03:46.850
Isn't that a little too bold?

00:03:47.420 --> 00:03:49.290
Don't you like impatient girls?

00:03:49.930 --> 00:03:54.790
Yeah, but I'm more of a romantic than I look.

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:12.850
You're so strong. I'm so attracted to it.

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.170
<i>This woman has a devil inside.</i>

00:04:17.940 --> 00:04:21.470
<i>She's completely changed from how she was at the bar.</i>

00:04:21.470 --> 00:04:26.650
<i>It was very different from what I'd expected, but I'm not complaining.</i>

00:05:06.290 --> 00:05:07.570
You...

00:05:08.160 --> 00:05:10.560
You realized a little too late.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:16.180
You're of no use to me anymore.

00:05:25.770 --> 00:05:27.090
Embrace me...

00:05:32.810 --> 00:05:35.010
You barely escaped, huh?

00:05:35.010 --> 00:05:37.950
It's fine. I already got what I wanted.

00:05:38.690 --> 00:05:40.190
What did you do to Kanako?

00:05:43.600 --> 00:05:45.680
You're worried about the girl?

00:05:45.680 --> 00:05:47.080
I didn't kill her.

00:05:47.080 --> 00:05:50.070
I just made her sleep in the restroom, at the bar.

00:05:52.950 --> 00:05:54.430
See you soon.

00:06:12.800 --> 00:06:14.890
<i>What is going on?</i>

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:19.560
<i>It's close to the peace treaty's renewal...</i>

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.120
Yes, you're right. Yes.

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.060
Oh, of course I do.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:48.930
Yes sir, I will do it.

00:06:49.750 --> 00:06:52.060
Yes, thank you very much.

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:53.300
I'll talk to you later.

00:06:54.940 --> 00:06:56.800
Mr. Taki, the President wants to see you.

00:06:56.800 --> 00:06:57.680
Yes.

00:07:00.530 --> 00:07:03.710
Oh, I guess your playboy lifestyle has caught up with you.

00:07:03.710 --> 00:07:04.860
Take care of yourself.

00:07:06.190 --> 00:07:09.860
Thanks for your concern. It pierced my heart.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.870
Hey Taki, you want to join us today?

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:16.710
Mahjong? Sounds good!

00:07:16.710 --> 00:07:20.120
But I'm completely broke.

00:07:20.120 --> 00:07:21.810
You'd better look for another sucker.

00:07:22.560 --> 00:07:24.770
There's no bigger sucker than you.

00:07:24.770 --> 00:07:25.760
See ya!

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:30.010
You guys are all the suckers.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.530
<i>I am Renzaburo Taki.</i>

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.880
<i>I work at the sales department of an electronics company in Shibuya, Tokyo.</i>

00:07:36.880 --> 00:07:38.640
<i>That's my official job.</i>

00:07:40.760 --> 00:07:43.370
Mr. Taki from the sales department is here.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:44.790
Let him in.

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:48.970
It's a MacGreggor, isn't it?

00:07:49.780 --> 00:07:53.370
Yes. I finally got one.

00:07:53.370 --> 00:07:55.340
The grip and hit are really nice.

00:07:55.340 --> 00:07:56.780
It's perfect, just what I expected.

00:07:58.050 --> 00:07:59.500
I like it.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:04.050
By the way, I heard you had a strange experience.

00:08:09.620 --> 00:08:12.780
I guess we can't trust the peace treaty.

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:14.550
Is it those extremists?

00:08:14.550 --> 00:08:16.300
It seems so...

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:20.270
but for now, I filed a complaint with their leaders through the Vatican.

00:08:20.270 --> 00:08:23.190
Well, you'd better be careful which women you date.

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:25.810
Your biggest weakness is women.

00:08:26.490 --> 00:08:30.970
Any reason for them to be taking action now?

00:08:30.970 --> 00:08:35.580
The signing ceremony date for the next peace treaty has been moved up.

00:08:35.580 --> 00:08:38.610
It will be held tomorrow, in Tokyo.

00:08:39.710 --> 00:08:41.530
That's very sudden.

00:08:41.530 --> 00:08:45.600
Investigations has discovered that people from the other side

00:08:45.600 --> 00:08:48.510
have illegally infiltrated this side by using a shield breaker.

00:08:48.510 --> 00:08:51.040
We must take care of this quietly.

00:08:51.040 --> 00:08:52.070
As you know,

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:55.360
I have no doubt, that when this peace treaty is signed,

00:08:55.360 --> 00:08:58.970
it will start a new era in the relationship between our sides.

00:08:59.810 --> 00:09:04.390
The terms of this treaty will continue the peace for another 500 years.

00:09:05.190 --> 00:09:08.350
Anyway, a V.I.P. is arriving at Narita airport, 7 p.m. tonight.

00:09:08.350 --> 00:09:12.700
He's attending the signing ceremony.

00:09:12.700 --> 00:09:15.910
So I want you to guard him until tomorrow.

00:09:16.800 --> 00:09:20.040
Mr. Black Guard, Renzaburo Taki.

00:09:26.830 --> 00:09:30.980
<i>The Black Guard, that's my other face.</i>

00:09:30.980 --> 00:09:35.090
<i>Your life is always in danger with that job.</i>

00:09:40.110 --> 00:09:42.310
Who is he?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:44.180
Giuseppi Mayart.

00:09:44.180 --> 00:09:46.270
You must have heard of him.

00:09:46.900 --> 00:09:48.690
He's finally coming here?

00:09:48.990 --> 00:09:51.430
We can't close the peace treaty without him.

00:09:51.430 --> 00:09:52.940
Please guard him closely.

00:09:52.940 --> 00:09:58.200
He'll be the main target of the extremists who are against this treaty.

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:01.780
Thank you for giving me such a thoughtful assignment.

00:10:03.880 --> 00:10:05.450
I will do my best.

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.820
Oh, one more thing.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.790
They want to assign you a partner.

00:10:10.790 --> 00:10:13.960
Her skills are the very best and I hear she's good looking, too.

00:10:14.700 --> 00:10:15.710
Well.

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:18.050
She'll be waiting for you at the airport.

00:10:18.050 --> 00:10:21.500
Look for the best looking woman there.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.970
One more thing. She's from the other side.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.980
A Black Guard from the other side?

00:10:27.330 --> 00:10:30.980
Yes, so don't get any strange ideas.

00:10:31.570 --> 00:10:33.530
Don't worry.

00:10:33.530 --> 00:10:37.950
I know better than anybody, how scary the women are from the demon world.

00:10:48.860 --> 00:10:52.330
<i>There is the world where humans live, and then there is another world...</i>

00:10:52.330 --> 00:10:54.200
<i>The demon world.</i>

00:10:54.200 --> 00:10:56.960
<i>We've been in contact with each other throughout our histories.</i>

00:10:56.960 --> 00:11:01.870
<i>The two worlds have sought interaction, harmony, and coexistence...</i>

00:11:01.870 --> 00:11:06.680
<i>Still, there have been fierce and bitter battles... fought between our worlds, again and again.</i>

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:14.820
<i>Finally, the heads of our two worlds made a treaty for coexistence.</i>

00:11:14.820 --> 00:11:18.050
<i>It was a kind of secret deal.</i>

00:11:18.570 --> 00:11:23.030
<i>The truce is renewed every couple of hundred years.</i>

00:11:23.030 --> 00:11:26.540
<i>And now, as we approach the end of the twentieth century,</i>

00:11:26.540 --> 00:11:32.530
<i>these two worlds are trying to close a new peace treaty.</i>

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.560
I guess we can't resolve this with friendly conversation.

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.070
Do you think that toy will work on us?

00:13:22.470 --> 00:13:24.310
Don't worry,

00:13:24.310 --> 00:13:27.070
this toy isn't what you think it is.

00:13:27.450 --> 00:13:29.390
Is that so?

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:22.880
I'll get you this time.

00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:41.150
Shit.

00:14:58.210 --> 00:15:01.140
You're so... cute.

00:15:03.220 --> 00:15:07.090
But you don't belong in this world.

00:15:07.880 --> 00:15:09.230
Goodbye.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:29.070
I guess you're my partner.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:30.110
You saved my life.

00:15:30.510 --> 00:15:34.370
For a skilled guard of this side, you're quite a wimp.

00:15:35.500 --> 00:15:37.760
I am much obliged by your honest opinion.

00:15:37.760 --> 00:15:38.350
I'm...

00:15:38.350 --> 00:15:41.630
Renzaburo Taki, 25 years old.

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:46.570
Height 180 cm, weight 65 kg, blood type AB.

00:15:46.570 --> 00:15:49.360
Official job is a salesman of an electronics company.

00:15:49.360 --> 00:15:51.490
Monthly salary is 230,000 yen.

00:15:51.490 --> 00:15:52.860
Single.

00:15:53.380 --> 00:15:54.840
Bingo!

00:15:54.840 --> 00:15:58.390
And you? Don't forget to include your measurements, too.

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:01.710
I'm Makie, no last name.

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:04.000
My job on this side is as a model.

00:16:04.000 --> 00:16:06.160
But I have no reputation to speak of.

00:16:06.160 --> 00:16:09.150
The sponsors don't like me because I scared off all the other models.

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.810
I see.

00:16:10.810 --> 00:16:13.140
Your beauty is too perfect.

00:16:13.140 --> 00:16:15.160
It's almost unreal.

00:16:15.610 --> 00:16:17.630
Thank you for the compliment.

00:16:17.630 --> 00:16:19.280
Now we have to hurry.

00:16:19.280 --> 00:16:21.160
He will be arriving soon.

00:16:21.570 --> 00:16:24.430
Your dedication to the job is such a sad thing.

00:16:24.430 --> 00:16:26.390
But it's nice to meet you.

00:16:38.470 --> 00:16:42.350
What kind of person will we be guarding?

00:16:44.190 --> 00:16:46.480
Giuseppi Mayart.

00:16:46.480 --> 00:16:49.430
A traditional mystic and a great psychic medium.

00:16:49.430 --> 00:16:53.040
I believe he had retired and was living in the ruins of Pompeii,

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:57.160
or at the head of the Apollonian Mountains, after he attended the signing ceremony

00:16:57.160 --> 00:16:59.740
of the last treaty in 1851.

00:16:59.740 --> 00:17:03.160
I heard he's the key person for the signing ceremony.

00:17:03.910 --> 00:17:06.670
Anyway, I hope everything goes smoothly.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:10.040
But why did they choose you as my partner?

00:17:10.040 --> 00:17:12.170
I guess you must have great skill.

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:15.680
You mean you don't trust women from the demon world?

00:17:15.680 --> 00:17:20.180
Almost never. I've had a very bad experience.

00:17:20.180 --> 00:17:22.520
You probably deserved it.

00:17:22.520 --> 00:17:23.640
I guess so.

00:17:23.640 --> 00:17:26.620
This partnership is not what I wanted either.

00:17:26.620 --> 00:17:29.320
But I simply follow my superior's orders.

00:17:29.910 --> 00:17:31.020
It doesn't matter.

00:17:31.020 --> 00:17:33.880
We have to stick together until this assignment ends.

00:17:33.880 --> 00:17:35.060
I agree.

00:17:52.550 --> 00:17:54.300
Shit! It's them!

00:18:01.980 --> 00:18:05.840
This is going too far just to kill one person.

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:07.030
It's terrible.

00:18:07.030 --> 00:18:08.860
Indeed.

00:18:10.460 --> 00:18:14.390
I had sensed danger, so I moved up to an earlier flight.

00:18:14.390 --> 00:18:16.450
I guess I was right.

00:18:16.450 --> 00:18:17.740
Who are you?

00:18:19.620 --> 00:18:21.450
I'm Giuseppi Mayart.

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:25.080
Nice to be with the two of you tonight.

00:18:27.220 --> 00:18:30.420
Well, I was told that a woman from the other side would be guarding me.

00:18:30.420 --> 00:18:33.960
You're much more beautiful than I had expected.

00:18:39.290 --> 00:18:41.370
Don't be rude! What did you just do to me?!

00:18:41.370 --> 00:18:42.840
You're the rude one.

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:46.930
What do you mean?! This is a greeting in the human world!

00:18:50.420 --> 00:18:54.940
Mr. Mayart, I think it's good that you're so lively, but you have to be a little discreet.

00:18:55.770 --> 00:18:57.940
Even though it's just for tonight,

00:18:57.940 --> 00:19:02.320
she and I have been assigned to protect your life.

00:19:02.320 --> 00:19:06.060
You can do anything you want after the treaty is signed tomorrow,

00:19:06.060 --> 00:19:09.140
but until then, I want you to follow our rules.

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.310
What's the big deal?

00:19:12.310 --> 00:19:13.990
She's just a woman of the demon world.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:17.600
Who knows what kind of real form she has under that beauty.

00:19:17.600 --> 00:19:22.770
You must know what happens to the people who sleep with them.

00:19:22.770 --> 00:19:26.820
Their life energies are sucked out, and they become zombies!

00:19:26.820 --> 00:19:31.910
Do you know why so many people still want to have sex with them?

00:19:31.910 --> 00:19:33.480
Because of how it feels.

00:19:33.480 --> 00:19:35.910
People feel such incredible ecstasy,

00:19:35.910 --> 00:19:41.090
it can't even compare with human sex.

00:19:41.090 --> 00:19:43.420
You should be careful too, because–

00:19:43.420 --> 00:19:45.640
You should watch your tongue, sir.

00:19:45.640 --> 00:19:50.340
I don't feel confident that I can protect you by myself.

00:19:50.340 --> 00:19:53.110
You don't have to worry about that. A job is a job.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:56.250
I will protect anyone, even at the risk of my own life.

00:19:56.250 --> 00:19:59.210
Oh, those words make me feel really secure.

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.870
Then I leave the matter to both of you.

00:20:01.870 --> 00:20:03.890
Please make sure that no danger comes to me.

00:20:08.780 --> 00:20:14.410
But, I still want to taste this special ecstasy at least once.

00:20:26.330 --> 00:20:28.940
Anyway, where are you taking me?

00:20:28.940 --> 00:20:30.880
A special hotel built with an energy barrier

00:20:30.880 --> 00:20:33.330
to shield us from the demon world.

00:20:33.330 --> 00:20:36.840
It was made for the safety of special V.I.Ps., like yourself.

00:20:37.790 --> 00:20:39.920
This place seems boring.

00:20:39.920 --> 00:20:41.890
I came all the way to Tokyo.

00:20:41.890 --> 00:20:45.960
Can't I visit some cabaret club or a soapland?

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.890
I was looking forward to one of those.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:20.930
I want you to stay in your room.

00:21:20.930 --> 00:21:23.990
What a musty smell in here.

00:21:25.070 --> 00:21:26.900
I've been waiting for you.

00:21:26.900 --> 00:21:29.720
I'm the owner of this hotel.

00:21:30.730 --> 00:21:36.000
You must be exhausted after such a long trip to come here.

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:38.850
As you can see, our hotel is not luxurious, but

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:43.070
I hope you will find it comfortable.

00:21:43.070 --> 00:21:46.720
We will provide the best service we can...

00:21:48.690 --> 00:21:51.240
Long time no see. Are you doing well?

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:54.420
Indeed. I've heard you are doing well too.

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:56.130
How are the guest arrangements today?

00:21:56.130 --> 00:21:58.750
Don't worry, it's just you guys.

00:21:59.330 --> 00:22:03.460
It seems like a big terrorist group on the other side wants to kill him.

00:22:03.460 --> 00:22:05.260
We should be careful, even if this area is protected from invasion.

00:22:06.000 --> 00:22:08.390
The barrier's resistance level has been increased three-fold.

00:22:08.390 --> 00:22:09.830
Don't be so nervous!

00:22:17.310 --> 00:22:18.300
How's he doing?

00:22:18.300 --> 00:22:21.020
He's pushing me to take him out and have some fun.

00:22:25.420 --> 00:22:27.050
Mr. Mayart.

00:22:27.050 --> 00:22:30.280
Oh, Taki. This woman is so stubborn!

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:34.000
Look at this. Soapland Playboy.

00:22:34.000 --> 00:22:36.540
They provide so many good looking women. Let's go there!

00:22:37.670 --> 00:22:39.530
You can't go anywhere.

00:22:40.520 --> 00:22:42.640
Oh... you don't like this place?

00:22:43.800 --> 00:22:46.000
How about this one? Cabaret Club Queen Mate!

00:22:46.000 --> 00:22:48.550
This must be the place for us! Let's go to this place!

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:52.300
I will go with you wherever you want, after this assignment.

00:22:53.190 --> 00:22:55.210
Damn you. You're so picky.

00:22:55.210 --> 00:22:57.240
How about this?! And don't complain anymore!

00:22:57.240 --> 00:22:58.990
Fashion Massage Love.

00:22:58.990 --> 00:23:00.360
Mr. Mayart!

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:05.630
I cannot give you permission to leave this room.

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:07.090
This is an order!

00:23:09.510 --> 00:23:11.650
Damn it. You're so stubborn.

00:23:11.650 --> 00:23:15.740
You will sleep with us in this room, tonight.

00:23:16.770 --> 00:23:19.410
No way. I certainly object.

00:23:19.410 --> 00:23:23.050
I'll sleep with that woman, but never with you.

00:23:23.050 --> 00:23:25.700
I can't sleep with a man being next to me.

00:23:26.240 --> 00:23:28.900
Then you don't have to sleep.

00:23:28.900 --> 00:23:31.220
Wh-Wh-What?!

00:23:31.220 --> 00:23:33.240
Who do you think I am?

00:23:33.240 --> 00:23:36.650
This peace treaty doesn't conclude without me.

00:23:36.650 --> 00:23:39.570
In spite of this, you still trap me in such a crappy hotel.

00:23:39.570 --> 00:23:40.480
This is outrageous!

00:23:40.960 --> 00:23:42.930
This hotel is located above the point where the most powerful

00:23:42.930 --> 00:23:45.080
spiritual energy can be transmitted in Tokyo.

00:23:45.080 --> 00:23:48.990
There is no way for them to enter.
They can't even come close to here.

00:23:48.990 --> 00:23:51.820
Then, why is that woman here?

00:23:51.820 --> 00:23:54.470
She is a member of the Black Guard from the other side.

00:23:54.470 --> 00:23:56.560
She has been trained for this situation.

00:23:58.220 --> 00:24:02.000
All right, if I can be alone with her, I'll stay here.

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.500
Why don't you sleep in the hallway?

00:24:07.390 --> 00:24:09.510
Okay, I'll be with you Mr. Mayart.

00:24:11.110 --> 00:24:14.510
This is my chance to try a woman of the demon world.

00:24:16.230 --> 00:24:17.830
Keep your eye on him.

00:24:17.830 --> 00:24:22.070
If he does something strange, just tie him to the bed.

00:24:22.770 --> 00:24:24.830
D-Don't be rude!

00:24:24.830 --> 00:24:26.770
What the hell are you telling her?

00:24:27.180 --> 00:24:28.620
You fool!

00:24:28.620 --> 00:24:29.640
You nincompoop!

00:24:29.640 --> 00:24:31.110
Idiot!

00:25:03.070 --> 00:25:06.740
The guest upstairs is rather famous.

00:25:06.740 --> 00:25:07.810
Do you know him?

00:25:08.140 --> 00:25:10.130
Giuseppi Mayart...

00:25:10.130 --> 00:25:13.390
He came to Japan, incognito, twenty years ago.

00:25:13.390 --> 00:25:16.320
He hasn't changed much since then, but...

00:25:17.370 --> 00:25:18.320
What's wrong?

00:25:19.410 --> 00:25:22.490
I wonder a little, if he's for real or not.

00:25:22.490 --> 00:25:25.280
It's just my intuition, but in my humble opinion

00:25:25.280 --> 00:25:27.330
he might be a decoy.

00:25:27.860 --> 00:25:29.190
That might be possible.

00:25:29.190 --> 00:25:33.610
They use a decoy freely, to attract the enemy's attention to us.

00:25:33.610 --> 00:25:34.840
Oh, well.

00:25:37.900 --> 00:25:39.970
Anyway, are you still single?

00:25:40.390 --> 00:25:41.760
What kind of question is that?

00:25:41.760 --> 00:25:43.480
Can't you tell just by looking at me?

00:25:43.790 --> 00:25:45.450
How about the lady you came with?

00:25:45.450 --> 00:25:48.370
Don't joke. She's a woman from the other side.

00:25:48.370 --> 00:25:52.070
You can't have children, but I hear the sex is incredible.

00:25:54.690 --> 00:25:58.110
Well, I never thought I would hear such words coming from your mouth.

00:25:58.800 --> 00:26:00.480
Is that so?

00:26:00.480 --> 00:26:02.120
It's just a little talk.

00:26:02.550 --> 00:26:04.800
Do you like your job?

00:26:04.800 --> 00:26:06.840
I don't know.

00:26:06.840 --> 00:26:08.730
You must be proud of your work.

00:26:08.730 --> 00:26:12.790
It's very honorable to have such an important job, protecting both worlds.

00:26:12.790 --> 00:26:14.200
Is it?

00:26:14.200 --> 00:26:18.590
I don't know if it's worth protecting human or demon society

00:26:18.590 --> 00:26:21.700
by risking my own life.

00:26:24.480 --> 00:26:29.730
It's because you still don't have anything to truly protect.

00:26:29.730 --> 00:26:34.190
You'd better find something fast, then you'll understand its meaning.

00:26:34.190 --> 00:26:36.630
Something to protect? Is it so simple?

00:26:36.630 --> 00:26:37.920
It's that simple.

00:26:37.920 --> 00:26:40.140
Checkmate.

00:26:48.630 --> 00:26:51.000
Here, let's have one more game.

00:26:51.710 --> 00:26:54.710
Old man, you never give up.

00:26:55.400 --> 00:26:59.050
Don't complain! I'm helping you kill time.

00:27:15.850 --> 00:27:16.990
It's them!

00:27:17.500 --> 00:27:20.490
Bastards! They're trying to break the spiritual shield.

00:27:20.490 --> 00:27:23.420
It can't be... there's no way for them to enter here!

00:27:35.210 --> 00:27:36.460
Here they come!

00:28:34.780 --> 00:28:37.690
Mr. Mayart, stay put in there.

00:28:38.400 --> 00:28:39.440
I'll leave them to you...

00:28:56.870 --> 00:28:58.630
Makie, it's me.

00:29:02.410 --> 00:29:03.420
Jin?

00:29:04.710 --> 00:29:07.730
You look nice, wearing the clothes of this side.

00:29:07.730 --> 00:29:09.660
Very attractive.

00:29:12.830 --> 00:29:15.690
I guess you've joined hand in hand with the humans.

00:29:17.570 --> 00:29:19.170
Traitor!

00:29:27.300 --> 00:29:30.200
Why did you betray us? Tell me!

00:29:30.200 --> 00:29:33.660
Humans are such lowly creatures compared to us.

00:29:34.190 --> 00:29:37.270
They're fit only to serve us.

00:29:37.270 --> 00:29:39.790
There's no reason to be equal or fair.

00:29:40.670 --> 00:29:43.000
I don't even want you to understand.

00:29:51.650 --> 00:29:54.880
You're as stubborn as you used to be.

00:29:54.880 --> 00:29:58.940
I should have made you sleep with me back then.

00:29:59.640 --> 00:30:03.810
Do you think you can take my heart, if you take my body?

00:30:03.810 --> 00:30:05.190
That's just the way you think.

00:30:05.850 --> 00:30:07.700
Would you like to try?

00:30:07.700 --> 00:30:09.700
I'll make you crazy.

00:30:33.820 --> 00:30:35.010
Master.

00:30:36.590 --> 00:30:39.470
Don't worry, they only got my fake hand.

00:30:39.470 --> 00:30:41.000
You should go upstairs.

00:31:03.750 --> 00:31:08.220
How's this? Your body is more honest than you are.

00:31:18.870 --> 00:31:21.980
Y-You!

00:31:22.650 --> 00:31:24.170
Don't bother.

00:31:24.170 --> 00:31:25.980
You can't use that trick.

00:31:42.500 --> 00:31:43.580
Are you all right?

00:31:44.080 --> 00:31:45.380
Yes.

00:31:45.380 --> 00:31:46.980
Where is Mr. Mayart?

00:31:47.640 --> 00:31:49.590
He's hiding in the bathroom.

00:31:59.310 --> 00:32:03.000
What kind of mystic is he?

00:32:04.170 --> 00:32:06.070
Sorry Taki.

00:32:06.070 --> 00:32:08.910
I relied on the spiritual barrier too much.

00:32:08.910 --> 00:32:10.430
Can you find Mr. Mayart?

00:32:10.430 --> 00:32:14.860
Don't worry, I have an idea where he's going.

00:32:22.830 --> 00:32:26.200
This is paradise. I could never imagine such a great place.

00:32:26.200 --> 00:32:28.380
I'm glad I've lived long enough to experience this.

00:32:28.890 --> 00:32:31.470
I'm getting so worked up, since you're so pleased!

00:32:31.470 --> 00:32:33.450
I'll give you the full treatment.

00:32:34.670 --> 00:32:36.390
Here, why don't you lie down on your back.

00:32:36.390 --> 00:32:38.390
Here you are.

00:32:38.790 --> 00:32:42.140
Oh, sir! You have so much vitality.

00:32:43.980 --> 00:32:46.700
I can even outlast young men.

00:32:48.970 --> 00:32:51.230
Sir, how old are you?

00:32:51.230 --> 00:32:53.780
I've been living so long, I don't remember anymore.

00:32:53.780 --> 00:32:55.560
But I am well past 200.

00:32:55.560 --> 00:33:00.530
No way! Nobody your age can keep it up like that.

00:33:01.310 --> 00:33:04.540
We both have had a very long life.

00:33:05.010 --> 00:33:07.890
Anyhow, you have marvelous breasts.

00:33:09.070 --> 00:33:12.550
They're like art, created by God.

00:33:18.760 --> 00:33:21.560
Oh, you look like a baby doing that. You don't look 200 years old at all.

00:33:26.150 --> 00:33:27.000
Huh?

00:33:27.000 --> 00:33:29.570
I swallowed something. What was that?

00:33:29.570 --> 00:33:32.070
What are you talking about? I haven't had a baby yet.

00:33:32.070 --> 00:33:33.570
There's no milk.

00:33:33.990 --> 00:33:35.820
Here, let's continue.

00:33:42.130 --> 00:33:43.870
Paradise, paradise.

00:33:50.690 --> 00:33:52.820
Wha... What the hell is this?

00:33:54.630 --> 00:33:58.840
I am going to take you to the real paradise, Giuseppi Mayart!

00:33:59.160 --> 00:34:01.850
Y-You're a terrorist from the demon world?

00:34:14.000 --> 00:34:15.240
Mayart...?!

00:34:19.850 --> 00:34:22.320
If you kill me, the old man dies too.

00:34:22.880 --> 00:34:23.740
Do you want that?

00:34:26.670 --> 00:34:28.710
Taki, rescue Mr. Mayart.

00:34:49.800 --> 00:34:54.570
Both of your lives will end tonight, no matter how far you run.

00:34:56.000 --> 00:34:58.490
You're the one whose life will be ended.

00:35:10.080 --> 00:35:13.580
This isn't good. His life force is almost drained.

00:35:13.580 --> 00:35:15.810
We have to give him spiritual treatment.

00:35:15.810 --> 00:35:17.050
Where are we going?

00:35:17.050 --> 00:35:18.550
A spiritual treatment hospital.

00:35:18.550 --> 00:35:21.090
It will take one hour no matter how fast I drive.

00:35:21.880 --> 00:35:24.740
I hope he can hold out until then.

00:35:32.690 --> 00:35:36.710
There's no reaction to my psychic powers.

00:35:36.710 --> 00:35:39.110
He may not last more than thirty minutes.

00:35:40.640 --> 00:35:42.610
He's caused a lot of trouble.

00:35:51.100 --> 00:35:52.520
What's the matter?

00:35:52.520 --> 00:35:56.510
They are trying to pull us into a closed space.

00:35:56.510 --> 00:35:58.380
Now what?

00:36:19.070 --> 00:36:21.710
We've been locked inside of a demonic barrier.

00:36:21.710 --> 00:36:23.660
We're completely trapped.

00:36:24.560 --> 00:36:25.860
Stop the car.

00:36:25.860 --> 00:36:27.450
It's no use driving anymore.

00:36:36.260 --> 00:36:37.450
What are you going to do?

00:36:38.140 --> 00:36:40.890
Stay here with Mr. Mayart.

00:36:40.890 --> 00:36:42.630
I will break the barrier.

00:36:43.520 --> 00:36:45.140
That's too dangerous.

00:36:45.550 --> 00:36:49.150
I told you. I'm willing to risk my life for this assignment.

00:36:51.250 --> 00:36:53.640
But I haven't heard your measurements yet.

00:36:58.520 --> 00:36:59.400
Mr. Mayart!

00:37:01.230 --> 00:37:01.900
What's wrong?

00:37:06.820 --> 00:37:10.330
Shit! That soap girl was a parasite.

00:37:24.930 --> 00:37:25.930
What's going on?

00:38:09.550 --> 00:38:11.060
Makie!

00:38:12.120 --> 00:38:14.760
Taki... run away, hurry!

00:38:15.310 --> 00:38:17.060
Please protect Mr. Mayart.

00:38:50.300 --> 00:38:53.340
The barrier is about to open.

00:38:53.340 --> 00:38:56.360
Hurry... hurry up and run...

00:39:22.960 --> 00:39:24.170
Makie.

00:40:18.300 --> 00:40:20.730
<i>We're in Motoakasaka... Still far from the hospital.</i>

00:40:29.110 --> 00:40:31.210
<i>Makie is gone...</i>

00:40:31.210 --> 00:40:37.630
<i>She used up all her energy and power to break through the demonic barrier.</i>

00:40:37.630 --> 00:40:41.770
<i>She might have been blown up when the barrier was broken.</i>

00:40:45.440 --> 00:40:49.580
<i>She helped us by sacrificing herself. A woman from the demon world.</i>

00:40:50.150 --> 00:40:52.230
<i>I hope she's still alive.</i>

00:41:18.230 --> 00:41:20.620
How is his condition?

00:41:21.810 --> 00:41:24.240
His life force is incredible.

00:41:24.240 --> 00:41:26.510
I think he'll recover in less than thirty minutes.

00:41:27.330 --> 00:41:30.050
I want to make sure this place has enough protection.

00:41:30.400 --> 00:41:34.720
The spiritual barrier here is twenty times stronger than usual.

00:41:34.720 --> 00:41:39.890
It's totally different from the Teito Hotel in Hibiya.

00:41:41.810 --> 00:41:47.430
We've been fighting them for 5,000 years. We've learned a lot.

00:41:47.430 --> 00:41:48.400
That sounds good.

00:41:48.400 --> 00:41:49.800
Doctor!

00:41:49.800 --> 00:41:50.720
What's the matter?

00:41:50.720 --> 00:41:51.790
They're here!

00:41:51.790 --> 00:41:56.070
We're completely surrounded by a demonic barrier within a radius of five kilometers!

00:41:56.070 --> 00:41:58.350
Increase the barrier's strength.

00:41:58.350 --> 00:42:01.350
Send a request to India, Tibet, and Mt. Koya

00:42:01.350 --> 00:42:03.950
to strengthen the spiritual wave.

00:42:06.500 --> 00:42:10.340
Mr. Mayart, you still have a lot to go through.

00:42:16.340 --> 00:42:20.170
Can you hear me, Renzaburo Taki?

00:42:23.850 --> 00:42:26.680
I have something interesting to show you.

00:42:41.370 --> 00:42:42.490
Makie!

00:43:04.100 --> 00:43:05.310
How do you like it?

00:43:05.310 --> 00:43:08.440
Look upon this well. This is the end of a traitor.

00:43:08.440 --> 00:43:11.400
She is a resident of the demon world.

00:43:11.970 --> 00:43:15.980
But despite that, she assisted this ridiculous peace treaty.

00:43:15.980 --> 00:43:20.620
In addition, she killed her ex-lover. There is no forgiveness for her.

00:43:20.620 --> 00:43:23.530
I will let her serve the desires of these men.

00:43:23.530 --> 00:43:26.950
After that, I will torture her slowly.

00:43:26.950 --> 00:43:30.990
Mr. Taki, don't you want to rescue her?

00:43:30.990 --> 00:43:33.500
You may be able to do it.

00:43:33.500 --> 00:43:37.150
What do you think of that? Why don't you come here?

00:43:38.030 --> 00:43:39.180
Where are you?

00:43:39.180 --> 00:43:40.310
Wait!

00:43:41.230 --> 00:43:43.560
Don't go! This is a trick!

00:43:45.100 --> 00:43:49.270
But they have clearly challenged me!

00:43:51.630 --> 00:43:54.530
Are you serious?

00:43:54.530 --> 00:43:56.230
What do you think will happen to me?

00:43:56.230 --> 00:44:01.280
As a Black Guard, you're supposed to protect me.

00:44:01.650 --> 00:44:04.780
As long as you stay here,
they can't even touch you.

00:44:04.780 --> 00:44:08.230
Is she that important to you?

00:44:08.230 --> 00:44:11.320
Important enough to go and save her, leaving me here?

00:44:11.320 --> 00:44:12.650
Don't forget!

00:44:12.650 --> 00:44:14.350
She's a woman of the demon world!

00:44:14.350 --> 00:44:16.800
She's not human.

00:44:18.730 --> 00:44:22.550
She sacrificed herself to save you.

00:44:22.550 --> 00:44:24.040
Of course she should!

00:44:24.040 --> 00:44:27.130
I'm an irreplaceable mystic of this world.

00:44:27.130 --> 00:44:31.890
The peace treaty of the two worlds can't be signed without me.

00:44:31.890 --> 00:44:35.060
Don't even compare me with that monster bitch!

00:44:39.080 --> 00:44:44.530
She deserves to be raped and tortured by her fellow monsters.

00:44:45.100 --> 00:44:48.890
She may be even enjoying herself.

00:44:58.900 --> 00:45:00.530
I accept your challenge.

00:45:00.530 --> 00:45:01.790
Let me go there.

00:45:02.550 --> 00:45:05.550
My pleasure. I will guide you.

00:45:05.550 --> 00:45:07.550
Wha... what did you say?!

00:45:08.400 --> 00:45:11.210
Y-You would leave me here?!

00:45:11.210 --> 00:45:13.450
I haven't given you permission!

00:45:13.450 --> 00:45:15.600
Do you think you know what you're doing?!

00:45:15.600 --> 00:45:19.640
As a professional Black Guard, you're acting ridiculous!

00:45:19.640 --> 00:45:20.730
You fool!

00:45:20.730 --> 00:45:22.460
Damn you!

00:46:33.540 --> 00:46:36.300
Black Guard, Renzaburo Taki.

00:46:36.850 --> 00:46:41.010
My sworn enemy has fallen into our hands.

00:46:41.970 --> 00:46:44.110
Don't think that I will let you die easily.

00:46:44.550 --> 00:46:47.110
The woman... let Makie go.

00:46:47.110 --> 00:46:49.700
Are you in love with her?

00:46:49.700 --> 00:46:52.620
Do you want to sleep with her?

00:46:53.160 --> 00:46:54.890
Don't express your own dirty thoughts.

00:46:56.190 --> 00:46:57.480
It doesn't matter.

00:46:57.480 --> 00:47:00.970
I will test your ability as a man, right now.

00:47:00.970 --> 00:47:03.830
I will ask your body how much you're involved

00:47:03.830 --> 00:47:09.640
with this disgusting conspiracy that's secretly going on.

00:47:10.550 --> 00:47:11.640
What are you talking about?

00:48:00.640 --> 00:48:06.260
Come to me. Inside my body...

00:48:14.820 --> 00:48:19.580
No man can resist this.

00:48:19.580 --> 00:48:20.830
Come on...

00:48:21.960 --> 00:48:26.430
I will suck everything from you.

00:48:26.430 --> 00:48:27.860
Hurry...

00:48:30.320 --> 00:48:32.140
Come on! Hurry.

00:48:46.860 --> 00:48:51.150
How's this? Incredible, isn't it?

00:48:51.910 --> 00:48:55.380
You will do anything I want.

00:48:56.700 --> 00:49:00.870
Tell me about the conspiracy of your side.

00:49:01.620 --> 00:49:03.300
That woman...

00:49:03.950 --> 00:49:06.990
Makie. Did you sleep with her?

00:49:20.390 --> 00:49:21.390
Kill him.

00:49:43.680 --> 00:49:44.830
Makie.

00:49:46.300 --> 00:49:47.330
Taki...

00:49:53.260 --> 00:49:57.560
Are you the prince, came here to save the princess?

00:49:57.560 --> 00:49:59.900
Your fantasy ends here.

00:50:19.570 --> 00:50:21.580
The assimilation seems like it's finished.

00:50:25.130 --> 00:50:26.600
Do you understand

00:50:28.580 --> 00:50:32.590
what has just happened to the men you beat?

00:51:03.620 --> 00:51:05.790
Shoot! Shoot as much as you want!

00:51:32.340 --> 00:51:35.860
Renzaburo Taki, this is your end.

00:51:58.300 --> 00:52:01.510
Bastard! How do you have so much power?

00:53:04.850 --> 00:53:06.000
Are you all right?

00:53:06.890 --> 00:53:07.710
Yes.

00:53:09.430 --> 00:53:11.410
You have a deep wound.

00:53:16.890 --> 00:53:18.400
Thank you.

00:53:18.400 --> 00:53:19.890
I'm so happy.

00:53:19.890 --> 00:53:23.720
I never thought that you would have come here to save me.

00:53:23.720 --> 00:53:25.540
You're my partner.

00:53:25.540 --> 00:53:27.390
Of course I'll save you.

00:53:29.130 --> 00:53:32.100
I became the enemy's hostage.

00:53:32.810 --> 00:53:35.390
You abandoned your post, right in the middle of an assignment.

00:53:37.100 --> 00:53:39.940
We'll both be fired from the Black Guard.

00:53:42.360 --> 00:53:44.860
<i>There's something that worries me more.</i>

00:53:44.860 --> 00:53:48.800
<i>What's this conspiracy they were asking me about?</i>

00:53:48.800 --> 00:53:52.210
<i>Why did they want to know if I slept with Makie?</i>

00:53:53.080 --> 00:53:55.430
<i>Is there a secret conspiracy going on...</i>

00:53:55.430 --> 00:53:57.750
<i>behind the peace treaty being signed tomorrow?</i>

00:53:59.640 --> 00:54:03.490
Was the man who came to the hotel your ex-boyfriend?

00:54:03.490 --> 00:54:04.980
That's history.

00:54:05.740 --> 00:54:09.010
He completely changed after being brainwashed by the terrorists.

00:54:09.640 --> 00:54:10.890
He was a nice person before.

00:54:12.060 --> 00:54:15.360
I had no choice but to kill him.

00:54:15.360 --> 00:54:20.100
Don't worry. That's the way our job goes.

00:54:21.010 --> 00:54:23.900
Why did you become a Black Guard?

00:54:24.620 --> 00:54:29.180
There are so many people who want peace in both worlds.

00:54:29.880 --> 00:54:32.750
Both worlds need to coexist with each other.

00:54:33.330 --> 00:54:36.920
For that to happen, somebody has to do this job.

00:54:38.350 --> 00:54:41.130
Is Mr. Mayart well?

00:54:41.130 --> 00:54:43.510
He's being protected at the spiritual hospital.

00:54:44.400 --> 00:54:45.820
Do you want to pick him up?

00:54:45.820 --> 00:54:46.930
Can you move?

00:54:47.510 --> 00:54:51.330
Your psychic powers have healed me well. I'm already cured.

00:54:51.330 --> 00:54:53.740
But, you'll get cold dressed like that.

00:55:23.280 --> 00:55:24.710
What do you think?

00:55:28.280 --> 00:55:29.600
You look great.

00:55:30.320 --> 00:55:32.720
Now I can imagine you working as a model.

00:55:33.910 --> 00:55:36.470
You told me before, I have unreal beauty.

00:55:37.120 --> 00:55:39.190
Now, I don't feel so anymore.

00:55:41.190 --> 00:55:42.970
You just have perfect beauty.

00:55:42.970 --> 00:55:44.060
Really?

00:55:44.060 --> 00:55:46.570
Yeah, just perfect.

00:55:47.310 --> 00:55:48.620
Oh, I'm glad.

00:56:02.860 --> 00:56:06.420
Already acting like boyfriend and girlfriend.

00:56:06.420 --> 00:56:08.460
You guys must've had lots of fun, huh?

00:56:09.200 --> 00:56:13.970
Your job is supposed to be guarding Mr. Mayart!

00:56:14.730 --> 00:56:17.720
How could you walk away from it and just do whatever you feel like?!

00:56:18.260 --> 00:56:20.430
You have disgraced me!

00:56:21.040 --> 00:56:22.950
You guys are so happy-go-lucky.

00:56:22.950 --> 00:56:27.170
You must've went to a love hotel and made out.

00:56:27.170 --> 00:56:27.860
You rat!

00:56:28.240 --> 00:56:30.350
Both of you are dismissed.

00:56:30.350 --> 00:56:31.890
Please leave here.

00:56:32.470 --> 00:56:34.370
I will send you a formal notice, later.

00:56:34.700 --> 00:56:38.870
Go! Go! I'll have nothing to do with incompetent people like you two.

00:56:39.400 --> 00:56:40.400
Bye-bye.

00:56:45.420 --> 00:56:46.380
Mr. Taki.

00:56:48.470 --> 00:56:50.880
You have disappointed me.

00:56:50.880 --> 00:56:54.580
You had a lot of potential to become a great Black Guard,

00:56:54.580 --> 00:56:57.390
but you're too much of a romantic.

00:56:58.200 --> 00:57:00.510
That is your biggest flaw.

00:57:30.630 --> 00:57:33.880
Is that you? I've made a mess.

00:57:33.880 --> 00:57:36.220
I underestimated him a little.

00:57:37.100 --> 00:57:40.720
I'm sorry. I should have finished him off, before.

00:57:41.020 --> 00:57:44.190
We're the only survivors.

00:57:44.190 --> 00:57:46.440
There's no time to call for backup.

00:57:46.440 --> 00:57:49.030
Go and finish him, no matter what.

00:57:49.030 --> 00:57:50.370
Of course.

00:57:50.370 --> 00:57:53.310
And I have received the result of his body fluid analysis.

00:57:53.310 --> 00:57:54.810
We were right.

00:57:54.810 --> 00:57:56.700
He has the DNA?

00:57:56.700 --> 00:57:57.410
Yes.

00:57:57.410 --> 00:58:01.040
It will take a while for me to regenerate.

00:58:01.040 --> 00:58:02.470
You take over.

00:58:02.470 --> 00:58:04.730
I will take care of it.

00:58:27.800 --> 00:58:29.040
Taki.

00:58:29.610 --> 00:58:31.210
Don't say anything.

00:58:31.210 --> 00:58:32.930
It's not your fault.

00:58:32.930 --> 00:58:34.750
I did everything on my own.

00:58:36.410 --> 00:58:40.610
I guess a romantic isn't right for this job.

00:58:40.610 --> 00:58:42.870
That's true. Especially for me.

00:59:44.180 --> 00:59:48.310
Well, I am quite a romantic myself.

00:59:48.640 --> 00:59:50.000
Mr. Mayart!

00:59:52.320 --> 00:59:53.810
Why did you follow us?!

00:59:54.140 --> 00:59:58.000
Well, there are no sexy nurses in that hospital.

00:59:58.000 --> 01:00:00.560
All of them are rough men.

01:00:00.560 --> 01:00:02.570
It felt so stuffy being there.

01:00:02.950 --> 01:00:04.840
That isn't a good excuse!

01:00:04.840 --> 01:00:08.740
Hey, hey. Can we go to a place called "Cabaret Club" next?

01:00:08.740 --> 01:00:09.920
Don't joke!

01:00:09.920 --> 01:00:12.120
We were fired from being your babysitter!

01:00:16.470 --> 01:00:18.710
Don't be so hard on yourself.

01:00:18.710 --> 01:00:22.950
Let's just do what I want to do and I'll take all the blame for this.

01:00:22.950 --> 01:00:27.930
Mr. Mayart, don't you realize you have a very important job?

01:00:27.930 --> 01:00:32.110
I know, I know! I certainly know that!!

01:00:32.110 --> 01:00:34.380
But I still have a little time until then.

01:00:34.380 --> 01:00:35.990
I refuse!

01:00:35.990 --> 01:00:38.080
I will take you back to the Teito Hotel.

01:00:38.080 --> 01:00:40.510
It's much closer than taking you back to the hospital.

01:00:40.510 --> 01:00:44.450
Fine! Do that! I can escape from there anytime.

01:00:51.050 --> 01:00:51.710
Taki!

01:01:18.420 --> 01:01:20.630
Makie, are you all right?

01:01:20.630 --> 01:01:21.820
Yes.

01:01:21.820 --> 01:01:23.150
She's coming.

01:01:43.240 --> 01:01:44.920
Nice to see you again.

01:02:03.490 --> 01:02:04.240
Taki!

01:02:11.390 --> 01:02:12.290
Makie.

01:02:12.770 --> 01:02:14.490
Traitor!

01:02:14.490 --> 01:02:18.320
How could your heart be stolen by a human man?

01:02:20.120 --> 01:02:23.560
People who love each other can die together.

01:02:23.560 --> 01:02:25.300
What an envious ending!

01:02:26.430 --> 01:02:30.640
I will chop up both of your cursed bodies.

01:03:25.760 --> 01:03:28.050
Who the hell are you?!

01:04:38.210 --> 01:04:39.370
Taki.

01:06:09.980 --> 01:06:11.380
Is this a dream?

01:06:15.240 --> 01:06:18.740
If this is a dream, I don't want it to end.

01:06:25.980 --> 01:06:27.290
Tears...

01:06:30.280 --> 01:06:31.520
This is strange...

01:06:32.440 --> 01:06:35.650
We, who live in the demon world, shouldn't have tears.

01:06:36.360 --> 01:06:39.700
Why do I have tears inside of me?

01:06:50.640 --> 01:06:54.560
Whatever has happened... I guess we're still alive.

01:06:55.680 --> 01:06:57.940
I wonder who brought us here?

01:06:59.610 --> 01:07:01.100
Maybe God.

01:07:02.230 --> 01:07:03.870
I want to think so.

01:07:20.860 --> 01:07:22.480
Be careful.

01:07:22.480 --> 01:07:23.850
They're very close.

01:08:05.220 --> 01:08:06.780
Giuseppi Mayart!

01:08:06.780 --> 01:08:09.440
What are you doing? The enemy is behind you!

01:08:22.310 --> 01:08:27.120
Perfect! I've finally encountered the real enemy!

01:08:27.870 --> 01:08:29.650
You guys should hurry and go.

01:08:34.150 --> 01:08:36.260
Go? Where should we go to?

01:08:36.260 --> 01:08:40.080
To the signing ceremony of the peace treaty, of course.

01:08:40.080 --> 01:08:41.540
That's where you should go!

01:08:43.600 --> 01:08:45.010
Both of you are the ones who must go.

01:08:45.600 --> 01:08:47.160
Us?

01:08:47.160 --> 01:08:48.950
You still don't realize it?

01:08:50.130 --> 01:08:52.570
It wasn't you two who were guarding me.

01:08:52.570 --> 01:08:56.520
I was called here to guard you two.

01:09:01.670 --> 01:09:04.770
Then it was you who carried us here and healed us?

01:09:04.770 --> 01:09:08.010
Yes. I used my psychic powers to heal both of you.

01:09:08.010 --> 01:09:09.350
What's this all about?

01:09:09.350 --> 01:09:10.810
Listen well.

01:09:13.140 --> 01:09:18.610
To ensure a lasting peace, we felt that some kind of spiritual exchange was needed.

01:09:18.610 --> 01:09:22.200
Something representing the spiritual wave between the human world and the demon world.

01:09:24.910 --> 01:09:28.570
But the biggest barrier that kept our two worlds from interacting

01:09:28.570 --> 01:09:30.810
is that there's no way to mix the blood of our peoples.

01:09:37.560 --> 01:09:40.500
However, after a few thousand years of effort,

01:09:40.500 --> 01:09:42.540
some spiritual mutation had occurred.

01:09:42.540 --> 01:09:45.070
There are still very few, but

01:09:45.870 --> 01:09:49.240
we've produced some subjects whose DNA can be mixed with each other.

01:09:49.240 --> 01:09:53.830
And the scientists of both worlds selected the best couple.

01:09:54.340 --> 01:09:57.330
You and Makie are the first couple.

01:09:57.330 --> 01:10:03.190
You two can have a child who bears the gifts from both worlds.

01:10:03.190 --> 01:10:08.330
And that is the child who will become the leader of a new world.

01:10:10.610 --> 01:10:11.840
Our...

01:10:12.890 --> 01:10:13.810
...child?

01:10:14.110 --> 01:10:15.810
Indeed.

01:10:17.270 --> 01:10:21.170
These terrorists are afraid of that, and have tried to kill you.

01:10:27.930 --> 01:10:29.120
You doddering old fool!

01:10:29.120 --> 01:10:31.830
How much longer will you interfere with us?

01:10:32.300 --> 01:10:36.310
Oh, it's you? Still alive? What are you made of?

01:10:37.240 --> 01:10:39.820
We both should have taken each other more seriously.

01:10:40.550 --> 01:10:41.840
Let's bring this to an end.

01:11:18.410 --> 01:11:21.740
Go and eat him up until he's just bones!

01:11:54.200 --> 01:11:58.040
Our power is far beyond any human's ability.

01:12:05.940 --> 01:12:07.380
Y-You bastard!

01:12:13.430 --> 01:12:15.960
Bastard!

01:13:15.370 --> 01:13:17.730
Taki, are you all right?

01:13:17.730 --> 01:13:19.220
Y-Yeah...

01:13:21.730 --> 01:13:24.330
I used too much power.

01:13:42.230 --> 01:13:44.230
Are you still trying to regenerate?

01:13:53.110 --> 01:13:57.260
I guess rapidly regenerating in his condition must have some side effects.

01:13:57.260 --> 01:13:58.530
Don't shoot!

01:13:59.180 --> 01:14:02.540
That piece of meat will just keep on regenerating.

01:14:14.880 --> 01:14:17.010
Well, here we go!

01:14:17.010 --> 01:14:19.100
Come on and fight me! I'll turn you into a puff of smoke.

01:14:35.640 --> 01:14:36.690
Makie.

01:14:38.960 --> 01:14:40.080
Is she...?

01:15:02.450 --> 01:15:04.220
What a miracle!

01:15:05.830 --> 01:15:07.980
This is the effect of the mutation.

01:15:46.520 --> 01:15:48.350
She has definitely conceived.

01:15:48.350 --> 01:15:51.020
This power is the best proof.

01:15:51.740 --> 01:15:54.920
Makie is already pregnant, with your baby.

01:15:54.920 --> 01:15:57.990
I never imagined the symptoms would come so quickly.

01:16:05.840 --> 01:16:08.910
There was one condition needed in order for Makie to conceive a baby.

01:16:08.910 --> 01:16:16.090
The laboratory concluded that in order to conceive and transfigure the DNA

01:16:16.090 --> 01:16:19.820
the couple had to have a spiritual bond of love.

01:16:19.820 --> 01:16:24.360
That's why I made you go through all this effort. In order to bring out your love for each other.

01:16:25.720 --> 01:16:27.060
I don't believe this.

01:16:27.990 --> 01:16:32.040
There was no other way, under such a tight schedule.

01:16:32.040 --> 01:16:33.060
Forgive me.

01:16:34.120 --> 01:16:35.830
You're an old fool!

01:16:35.830 --> 01:16:38.420
Everything was planned ahead?

01:16:38.420 --> 01:16:39.960
I'm afraid so.

01:16:39.960 --> 01:16:45.580
However, nobody could predict if the two of you could love each other.

01:16:46.600 --> 01:16:48.830
I feel like beating you up.

01:16:49.220 --> 01:16:52.530
Weren't you serious when you made love to Makie?

01:16:55.240 --> 01:16:56.650
Unfortunately, no.

01:16:58.470 --> 01:16:59.530
Is that so?

01:17:08.910 --> 01:17:10.780
That's what I thought, anyway...

01:17:10.780 --> 01:17:12.440
At first.

01:17:13.460 --> 01:17:14.540
Taki.

01:17:17.180 --> 01:17:20.430
Do you believe a woman of the demon world?

01:17:23.940 --> 01:17:27.950
Those tears you had. I believe they were real.

01:17:36.710 --> 01:17:39.950
My, my... the results have exceeded our expectations.

01:17:39.950 --> 01:17:42.590
Maybe, Taki won't beat me up.

01:17:42.590 --> 01:17:43.430
Well, shall we go?

01:17:44.960 --> 01:17:49.720
A new treaty, the start of a new life, and a new world.

01:18:09.950 --> 01:18:12.560
He's quite a character.

01:18:20.780 --> 01:18:22.690
<i>The long night ends.</i>

01:18:23.480 --> 01:18:25.220
<i>A bright day breaks.</i>

01:18:25.840 --> 01:18:27.820
<i>Just like the man at the hotel told me,</i>

01:18:27.820 --> 01:18:32.640
<i>someone whom I should protect is in my arms, right now.</i>

01:18:39.850 --> 01:18:43.150
<i>And there is my child,</i>

01:18:43.150 --> 01:18:47.470
<i>who doesn't even have shape, but is inside of her.</i>

01:18:48.220 --> 01:18:54.450
<i>This child may create a new future for both worlds, someday.</i>

01:18:59.350 --> 01:19:00.520
<i>But...</i>

01:19:00.520 --> 01:19:02.120
<i>Until that day...</i>

01:19:03.060 --> 01:19:08.220
<i>My job as a Black Guard won't end.</i>

01:19:49.990 --> 01:19:56.600
Your breath when you’re asleep is a lullaby for me

01:19:56.600 --> 01:20:03.180
I want to sleep beside you

01:20:03.180 --> 01:20:10.230
and forget those countless nights

01:20:10.230 --> 01:20:19.340
when we loved but in a way also hurt each other.

01:20:19.340 --> 01:20:25.620
Tonight the skyscrapers and high-rising towers

01:20:26.470 --> 01:20:37.140
are diamonds decorating the darkness.

01:20:38.600 --> 01:20:42.990
so hold me please in the shadow

01:20:42.990 --> 01:20:51.020
even in this lonely corner of the city

01:20:51.790 --> 01:20:56.260
so hold me please in the shadow

01:20:56.260 --> 01:21:06.840
our love is alive and no one can stop it.

01:21:15.010 --> 01:21:19.350
so hold me please in the shadow

01:21:19.350 --> 01:21:27.600
even in this lonely corner of the city

01:21:28.240 --> 01:21:32.660
so hold me please in the shadow

01:21:32.660 --> 01:21:43.500
our love is alive and no one can stop it.
